    <string name="about_app">About App</string>
    <string name="about_app_desc">Mara Lyrics is a free and open-source application created by the Mara Lyrics Team for the Mara community. It provides easy access to a large collection of Mara songs and lyrics, preserving and promoting Mara language and culture.\n\nThe app includes various categories of songs, including Gospel, Love, Patriotic, and Traditional songs. Users can browse, search, and read lyrics offline, making it useful for daily use, gatherings, cultural events, and personal enjoyment.\n\nTo keep the song collection accurate, Mara Lyrics checks for updates — such as corrected lyrics or newly added songs — and downloads them automatically in the background. Because this data is very small, updates apply quietly without asking or interrupting you, and only over Wi-Fi by default. This behavior can be adjusted anytime in Settings under Data &amp; Sync.\n\nMara Lyrics is developed for Mara people worldwide and is available free of charge. The project is community-driven and dedicated to supporting the growth and preservation of Mara language and heritage.</string>
